{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112173","id":2960108453,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6wb6ul","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112173","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112173.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112173.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112173","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112173/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112173/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112173/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c31b92ba196cf66b9347707b6237a3d57389e8d0","number":112173,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix layers property editor last bit value in tooltip","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Replaced `1 << shift` to `1u << shift` to not rely on auto casting to unsigned (and to be more explicit). In most cases the change is not really needed as auto casting would happen, but in case of string formatting for the tooltips there was no auto casting to unsigned, hence `%d` format string produced a negative value for the last bit.\r\n\r\nBefore|After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"417\" height=\"323\" alt=\"QP1D7vcCGl\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9d11fe2-26be-41eb-8248-63acfe5390c4\" />|<img width=\"417\" height=\"323\" alt=\"lVRsmlgS2Y\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b5713614-bf7e-4110-adbe-a095cb58d627\" />\r\n\r\n- While looking at the source, I've discovered the `Ctrl/Command`+`LMB` behavior, added in #39364 (I suspect not many users are aware of it). It was buggy, as the last bit would be not enabled when disabling some other bit. Fixed this as well.\r\n\r\nBefore|After\r\n-|-\r\n![Godot_v4 5 1-stable_win64_fqFwcvLkx3](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46b31063-4514-4165-8a46-93a3ec2dfbe9)|![godot windows editor dev x86_64_Mm2AsDYyQs](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/48c3c649-5d72-4375-a99f-0de312f552b3)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- I've also changed the indicator for _\"no hovered index\"_ from `INT32_MAX` to `UINT32_MAX`, and factored it out to `HOVERED_INDEX_NONE` constant. In fact any unsigned value greater than `31` could be used as such indicator, it was just a little bit puzzling why specifically `INT32_MAX == 0x7FFFFFFF` was used. Given `hovered_index` is `uint32_t` I think using `UINT32_MAX == 0xFFFFFFFF` makes just a little more sense.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"mi